					<<set $baileySpoke++>>
				<<else>>
					"갚을 생각도 없었으면서 애초에 왜 이 약골의 빚을 떠맡았는지 모르겠군." 베일리가 비웃는다.
				<</if>>
			<<default>>
				<<if $speechplead is 1 or $speechapologiseno is 1 or $speechapologiseunforgiving is 1>>
					베일리가 당신을 비웃는다. "오, 이제 와서 미안하다고? 이제 와서 대가를 치를 때가 되니까?"
					<<set $baileySpoke++>>
				<<elseif $speechscream is 1 or $speechdemand is 1>>
					"닥쳐." 베일리가 당신에게 쏘아붙인다. "네가 대가를 치르지 않았으니, <<nnpc_he "Robin">>【이가】 치르게 될 거다."
					<<set $baileySpoke++>>
				<<else>>
					"알겠어?" 베일리가 로빈을 보며 말한다. "<<pShe>>【이가】 대가를 치르지 않았으니, 네가 치르게 될 거다."
				<</if>>
		<</switch>>
		<<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 20 or C.npc.Robin.dom lte 30>>
			<<print either("로빈이 눈물 어린 눈으로 당신을 쳐다본다.","로빈이 훌쩍인다.","로빈이 베일리의 손아귀에서 힘없이 버둥거린다.","로빈이 당신에게 손을 뻗는다.")>>
		<<else>>
			<<print either("로빈은 용감한 표정을 짓는다.","로빈이 <<nnpc_his \"Robin\">> 이빨을 악문다.","로빈이 베일리의 손아귀에서 발버둥친다.","로빈이 베일리의 손아귀에서 거의 빠져나올 뻔한다.")>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		"<<nnpc_him "Robin">>【을를】 안전하게 지키고 싶어?" 베일리가 묻는다. "내게 말해. 앞으로는 돈을 내겠다고."
		<<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 1 or C.npc.Robin.dom lte 30>>
			로빈이 딸꾹질한다.
		<<else>>
			로빈이 <<nnpc_his "Robin">> 고개를 젓는다.
		<</if>>
		<<set $combatPhase to "pay">><<set $timer to 2>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<span class="red"><<person2>><<person>>【와과】 <<person3>><<person>>【이가】 당신을 단단히 붙잡는다.</span>
<<elseif $combatPhase is "pay">>
	<<if $speechpay is 1>>
		"그래, 그거야." 베일리가 비웃는다. "그게 그렇게 어려웠어?" <<He>>【이가】 <<his>> 부하들에게 손짓하자, 그들이 당신의 팔을 놓아준다.
		<<set _fin to 1>>
	<<elseif $speechpay is -1>>
		"이런, 안됐군." 베일리가 비웃는다. "하지만 내가 관대하게 굴어주지. 아직 <<nnpc_him "Robin">>【을를】 구할 수 있어. 그냥 가만히 있어."
		<br>
		로빈이 필사적으로 <<nnpc_his "Robin">> 고개를 젓는다.
		<<set $combatPhase to "still">><<set $timer to 2>>
	<<elseif $timer is 1>>
		베일리가 <<his>> 시계를 확인하는 척한다. "난 바쁜 <<personsimple>>【이】야. 만약 네가 <i>돈을 내지</i> 않는다면, 난 떠나겠어."
		<br>
		<span class="red"><<person2>><<person>>【와과】 <<person3>><<person>>【이가】 당신을 단단히 붙잡는다.</span>
	<<else>>
		"볼일 끝났어." 베일리가 비웃는다. "<<nnpc_him "Robin">> 대신 돈을 낼 생각이 없었다면, 애초에 내 시간을 낭비하지 말았어야지."
		<<set $finish to 1>><<set _fin to 1>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $combatPhase is "still">>
	<<if _defiance is undefined>>
		"좋아." 베일리가 부하들에게 고개를 끄덕이며 말한다. <<He>>【이가】 당신의 팔을 잡고 있는 부하들에게 고개를 끄덕이자, 그들이 당신을 고아원 밖으로 끌고 나간다.
		<br><br>
		<span class="red">당신이 끌려 나가는 동안 로빈이 눈물을 흘리며 당신의 이름을 외친다.</span>
		<<set _fin to 1>>
	<<elseif $timer is 1>>
		"내 말 들었어?" 베일리가 으르렁거린다. "<<nnpc_he "Robin">>【이가】 당하는 걸 원치 않으면, <i>발버둥치지 마</i>. 그냥 가만히 있어."
		<br>
		<span class="red"><<person2>><<person>>【와과】 <<person3>><<person>>【이가】 당신을 단단히 붙잡는다.</span> <<person2>><<persons>>【이가】 더 세게 움켜쥔다.
	<<else>>
		베일리가 얼굴을 찌푸린다. "볼일 끝났어. <<nnpc_him "Robin">> 대신 돈을 낼 생각이 없었다면, 애초에 내 시간을 낭비하지 말았어야지."
		<<set $finish to 1>><<set _fin to 1>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if _fin isnot 1>>
	<<actionsman>>
<</if>>

<<if $combatPhase is "pay" and $speechpay is 1>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|Rent First Robin Fight Finish]]>><<endevent>><<set $phase to "pay">><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<elseif $combatPhase is "still" and _defiance is undefined>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|Rent First Robin Fight Finish]]>><<endevent>><<set $phase to "still">><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<elseif $finish is 1>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|Rent First Robin Fight Finish]]>><<endevent>><<set $phase to "finish">><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|Rent First Robin Fight]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>
<<turnend>>

:: Rent First Robin Fight Finish
/* ============ 번역 필요 ============== */
<<effects>>
<<unset $robinRentEvent>>
<<set _robin to statusCheck("Robin")>>
<<npc Robin 1>><<person1>>

<<if $phase is "pay">>
	Bailey lets go of Robin, who runs up to and embraces you. <<He>> sobs softly.
	<br><br>
	<<rentpay>>

	Bailey walks off, and Robin continues clinging to you.
	<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
		"I th-thought..." <<He>> chokes up and holds you tighter.
	<<else>>
		"I thought I was going to lose you," <<he>> says after a long moment.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	You gently hold <<his>> hand, and <<if robinromance is 1>>give <<him>> a comforting kiss on the forehead.<<else>>wrap your other arm around <<his>> shoulder comfortingly.<</if>>
	<<takeHandholdingVirginity "Robin">>
	<br><br>

	Robin manages to calm down, the tears ebbing away.
	<<if _robin.dom gte 30>>
		"I need to become stronger..." <<he>> whispers under <<his>> breath, shaking <<his>> head.
	<</if>>
	"Thank you. For everything," <<he>> says. <<He>> eventually releases <<his>> embrace and goes back towards <<his>> room.
	<br><br>

	<<robinRentUnsafeMessage>>

	<<endcombat>><<clotheson>>

	<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $phase is "still">>
	The thugs drag you away. You hear Robin crying for you. <<His>> cries eventually fade away as you leave the orphanage. You are met face to face with Bailey.
	<br><br>

	<<npc Bailey 2>><<person2>>
	"Now was that so hard?" Bailey sneers as <<he>> covers your head and binds your arms. "You saved your little friend. This time."
	<br><br>

	<<robinRentUnsafeMessage>>

	<<endcombat>><<clotheson>>

	<<link [[Next|Rent Intro]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<robinPunishment "mansion">>
	Bailey drags Robin away. You struggle against the thugs' grip, but can't break free.
	<br><br>

	Eventually Bailey returns, and sneers at you. "Since I'm so generous, this will be a warning. Get me my money, or <<he>>'ll pay the price."
	<br><br>

	<<robinRentUnsafeMessage>>

	<<endcombat>><<clotheson>>

	<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Tutorial Bailey
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<npc Bailey 1>>

누군가 어깨에 손을 올리는 것이 느껴진다. 돌아보니 베일리다.
<br><br>
"바깥세상에 온 걸 환영한다. 일주일 내내 아무것도 안 한 것에 대해 교훈을 얻었길 바라지." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "이번 주에는 더 열심히 하길 기대하마. 또 돈을 못 내면 어떻게 되는지 보고 싶지 않을 테니 말이야."
<br><br>
당신은 베일리의 손에 이끌려 침실로 돌아와 홀로 남겨진다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
:: Widgets Bailey Confiscation [widget]
/* ============ 번역 필요 ============== */
/* Bailey Confiscation System */

<<widget "baileyConfiscationList">>
	<<set _list to baileyConfiscationParts()>><<if _list.length is 0>>your things<</if>><<for _p range _list>><<print _p.sep>><<if _p.kind is "furniture">><<if _p.icon>><<furnitureicon _p.icon>> <</if>><<elseif _p.kind is "clothing">><<clothingicon _p.item _p.slot>> <</if>><<print _p.name>><</for>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "baileyConfiscationListFull">>
	<<set _list to baileyConfiscationGrouped()>><<if _list.length is 0>>your things<</if>><<for _p range _list>><<print _p.sep>><<if _p.count gt 1>><<print _p.count>>× <</if>><<if _p.kind is "furniture">><<if _p.icon>><<furnitureicon _p.icon>> <</if>><<elseif _p.kind is "clothing">><<clothingicon _p.item _p.slot>> <</if>><<print _p.name>><</for>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "baileyRentConfiscation">>
	<<babyRent true>>
	<<set _weekRent to $rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0)>>
	<<set _bundle to baileyConfiscationBundle(_weekRent)>>
	<<if _bundle.items.length is 0>>
		A hand rests on your shoulder from behind. <span class="red">It's Bailey.</span>
		<<if $robinfirstrentfight and ($baileypaychain lt 2 or $renttime lte -1) and _robinAtOrphanage>>
			<<rentduerobin 0>>
		<<else>>
			<<rentdue 0>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
		<<run baileyConfiscationApply(_bundle)>>

		You step into the orphanage and see someone leaning against the hallway outside your room. <span class="red">It's Bailey.</span>
		<br><br>

		Across from <<him>>, you see a few goons carrying your <<baileyConfiscationList>> out of your room.	<span class="red">They're taking your belongings!</span> Bailey watches them work, unbothered.
		<br><br>

		"You've been dodging rent for weeks," <<he>> says. "Did you think I'd just let that slide?"
		<br><br>

		The goons start filing past you, whisking your stuff away without sparing you a glance.
		<br><br>

		"You have one week to pay up properly in my office before I pawn off your junk." <<He>> turns away from you, tossing a hand over <<his>> shoulder dismissively. "Don't make me come looking again."
		<br><br>

		<<set $renttime to 7>><<set $rentday to Time.weekDay>>
		<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Fight|Bailey Confiscation Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><<generateRole 1 0 "thug">><<generateRole 2 0 "thug">><<generateRole 3 0 "thug">><</link>><<dangerousText>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "baileyRentReclaimOption">>
	<<if $bailey_confiscation>>
		<<babyRent true>>
		<<set _owed to $rentmoney + ($babyRent or 0)>>
		<<if $money gte _owed>>
			<<highicon>><<link [[Reclaim your confiscated things|Bailey Rent Reclaim]]>><</link>> (<<printmoney _owed>>)
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<span class="blue">Reclaim your confiscated things <<printmoney _owed>> (You can't afford it)</span>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "baileyConfiscationNotice">>
	<<if $bailey_confiscation_lost is 1>>
		<<set $bailey_confiscation_lost to 0>>
		<span class="red">You didn't pay Bailey in time to get your things back.</span> <<nnpc_He "Bailey">> has probably pawned them off.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

